<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name><![CDATA[Bioprinting World Map — Research & Companies through 2025]]></name>
    <description><![CDATA[SOFE bioprinting research map. Publication window: 2000–2025; rankings use 2021–2025 unless stated. Data retrieved 27 October 2026.<br><br>Includes 38 companies, 5,342 geolocated institutions, 100 leading authors at 172 last-observed institutional locations, and the top 20 countries by cumulative publications. One institution could not be mapped.<br><br>Affiliations, Other affiliations, Authors and Companies are grouped by Country. Each main layer checkbox shows or hides all its countries. Other affiliations remain in three parts because of Google My Maps limits. Google lists 20 country groups per layer and combines additional countries under Other / No value; all records remain included and retain their Country field.<br><br>Company points approximate cities, not offices. Evidence dates and sources are retained in each company marker. Author points locate institutions observed through 2025, not current employment or nationality. Historical Allevi and grouped Allegro brands are excluded. This is a keyword-defined bibliographic dataset and a company shortlist, not a global census.<br><br>Sources, full data and methods: https://github.com/florencewmk/3D-Bioprinting/tree/main/data/geography-2025]]></description>
